{"id":"vod_sn_38379","vodId":"38379","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Butlers～千年百年物語～","name_cn":"Butlers～千年百年物語～","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3d7c9f3e06957d9fff05363aaa168d4a.jpg"},"summary":"在一次机缘巧合之下，和妹妹天奈（三泽纱千香 配音） 相依为命的杰（铃木达央 配音）穿越到了100年后的世界，杰震惊的发现，100后的他们曾经的宅邸，变成了一所学校。就这样，杰隐姓埋名改名为神宫司高马，开始在学校中一边学习，一边寻找回到过去世界的方法。　　在学校里，杰很快就结识了一帮好友。以自我为中心，谁也不放在眼里的大少爷藤代悠希（KENN 配音）、拥有可爱外表，并常常利用自己的可爱来操纵他人的青叶萤（永冢拓马 配音）、智商和人气都很高，但始终不会以真心待人的绯樱春人（丰永利行 配音）、拥有着和福尔摩斯一样的好奇心的茶野京一（小林千晃 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:00:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9AJpgJXicY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qzqPACAbLP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5SCsCN4YHu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jrB8sj7CiH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4RwVj7NdyR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dEbAkc9ajX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3EsdPL8hsx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BucrPbhq4n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S1RSdHpcRZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3nvKfbzR2A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4BdDh5wUyT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EEGHqbuDWV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ja4PWDbAkD1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:59.359Z"}